WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.979
Thread zero, two loads input row two,

00:00:02.979 --> 00:00:05.458
column zero into the shared tile. The

00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:07.583
block barrier makes that tile ready.

00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:14.972
Thread two, zero reads shared tile at two,

00:00:14.972 --> 00:00:17.139
zero. Which thread loaded that position?

00:00:25.639 --> 00:00:28.301
Thread zero, two loaded it. Thread two,

00:00:28.301 --> 00:00:30.962
zero writes that value into output row

00:00:30.962 --> 00:00:32.103
zero, column two.
